Third-party material in vfs-bench-2
===================================

vfs-bench-2 is MIT-licensed (see ../LICENSE). It runs other benchmarks
unchanged where it can. Their code and data are downloaded by each dataset's
setup script into state/, which is gitignored, at the source pinned below.
Apart from seven of LiveClawBench's tasks, none of that is redistributed
here.

What this directory does carry from them is small, and each entry names it:
prompts quoted or adapted in a dataset's index.ts, a rewritten tool guide,
a pinned dependency list, and LiveClawBench's seven task directories. The
MIT notices that cover those follow the entries, verbatim.


